# Rust build artifacts.
# Nested crate build dirs (crates/*/target, etc.) are ignored outright.
# The root target/ is ignored too, except for the shipped release binary --
# git can't re-include a path whose parent dir is excluded, so each level
# down to target/release/crtulum has to be re-included in turn.
**/*/target/
/target/*
!/target/release/
/target/release/*
!/target/release/crtulum
# (vendor/wgpu-hal is a tracked source patch, not a build dir.)
**/*.rs.bk

# Environment
.env

# Logs and capture output
*.log

# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Claude Code local state
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/settings.local.json
